      "value": "@{5f8a26770aaa28611fedd6b6|full_name}: So i've found out that the freezes start as soon as i have this animation (screenshot1) in this animator position (screenshot2), driven by Facetracking Parameter \"Smilesad\". \n\nUnfortunately i can't pin it down any further. \n\nI thought maybe the issue was that it had 2 keyframes. All my others had only 1 keyframe. But after some testing of doing that with other Animations, it still didn't happen.\n\nAlso tested around with other animations using vrc.blink for example, but didn't cause any freezes. \n\nHowever, when i put this animation back in the animator, it starts freezing. No idea why, but i'm just not gonna use that animation now i guess ^^'",
