  "details": "I am using a Vive Facial Tracker with the Software \"SRanipal\" and \"VRCFaceTracking\".\n\nAs soon as Face Tracking is toggled on in VRCFT Software, i somehow make the entire instance experience VRChat freezes.\n\nThe Freezes occur very frequently (every 5-20 seconds) and last rather long (2-15 seconds).\n\nAs soon as i toggle Face Tracking off in VRCFT Software, the freezes stop for everyone.\n\nSteamVR and everything else on your Computer is unaffected, its just VRChat that freezes.",
